<title>CANADA: Corby CEO to resign effective Oct. 28.</title>
<headline>Corby CEO to resign effective Oct. 28.</headline>
<dateline>MONTREAL 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Corby Distilleries Ltd said on Friday that president and chief executive officer Martin A. Jones has resigned effective October 28.</p>
<p>Jones is leaving Corby to assume the position of president of Domecq Importers Inc, a unit of Allied Domecq Plc.</p>
<p>&quot;An announcement regarding Mr. Jones' replacement is expected to be made as soon as possible,&quot; Corby said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100</p>
</text>
